config BR2_PACKAGE_DISTROBOX
	bool "distrobox"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_PODMAN
	help
	  Use any Linux distribution inside the terminal (podman
	  containers that share $HOME, the display and devices). The
	  developer's toolchain lane: Buildroot puts no compiler on the
	  target, so gcc/clang/rustc/go and headers live in a distrobox.
	  Buildroot 2026.08 does not ship it.

	  https://distrobox.it
